@startuml error_handling_sequence

participant "前端(Fragment/App)" as FE
participant "后台(Controller)" as BFF
participant "RestTemplate" as RT
participant "RestClientErrorHandler" as EH
participant "后端服务(BA/ABA)" as BE

FE -> BFF : ①发起请求
BFF -> RT : 调用后端接口
RT -> BE : ②转发HTTP请求
BE --> RT : 返回错误(4xx/5xx)
RT -> EH : ③hasError()=true\n触发handleError()

note over EH
  解析Body,判断BA/ABA
  组装errorCode/errorMsg
end note

EH --> BFF : ④抛出对应异常\n(如BadRequestException)
BFF --> FE : ⑤返回错误response

note over FE
  前端错误处理逻辑
  接收并解析response
end note

FE -> FE : ⑥展示AlertDialog

@enduml
